The code and CSS now reference WebP for the large decorative assets and PNG for the requested avatar tiles. I’m running a Pillow optimization pass next: convert oversized decorative PNGs to WebP, downscale motif art, copy the generated avatar textures into `assets/img/`, and compress the remaining PNG/JPG assets.
