Refinement pass complete. I did not deploy. Site changes are staged; `REFINE.md` and `_codex-refine.log` remain unstaged as pre-existing context files.

**Summary**
- Transformed People cards with generated abstract monogram avatar tiles; director still uses the real headshot.
- Removed dead publication affordances by rendering DOI/link only for valid non-empty `http(s)` URLs.
- Expanded the D3 constellation to 24 nodes, 39 links, readable labels, legend, mobile scroll behavior, and reduced-motion handling.
- Optimized `assets/img/` from roughly 18 MB to 1.74 MB total.
- Added footer quick links, university line, focus/hover polish, dividers, and back-to-top behavior.

**Verification**
- `node --check app.js` passed.
- Playwright/Chromium smoke passed on `http://127.0.0.1:4173/`.
- Checked desktop and 390px mobile: no console errors, nav works, 9 people cards, 8 monogram avatars, 1 real photo avatar, avatar assets load, XR chip present for director, XR filter works, publication links all valid, back-to-top works.

